{"4144660": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "I Believe In Gnomes", "steam_appid": 4144660, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144660/extras/8cfa8d3e8f544e3284475e88fbd63b8d.avif?t=1780081438\" width=512 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I Believe In Gnomes is a fast-paced 3D platformer that takes it's inspiration from video games in the early 2000's. You explore this vibrant world as Gnorbert the gnome. Enjoy a nostalgia trip that also has the qualities and appeal of a modern 3D platformer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144660/extras/9c6b32f14b1966dc86926fdce857147d.avif?t=1780081438\" width=512 height=256 /></span> <br>The game was intentionally designed for any kind of player. If you want to have a traditional 3D platformer experience you can. If you want to move as fast as possible, that will depend on your skill. The game has no speed cap and can be taken as fast or slow as desired. The game is best enjoyed when pulling off speedy jumps mixed with deeper exploration as you collect all the gnomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144660/extras/c9ab07e7df8d3deb9f1088b487f60085.avif?t=1780081438\" width=512 height=256 /></span><br>Our story begins as Gnorbert the garden gnome is visited by the Great Flamingo and called upon to cleanse the garden from evil. Explore the backyard, sandbox, house, and more as you seek to save your fellow gnomes from certain destruction. Mixed in with the seriousness of your quest is a whole lot of satire and comedy.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144660/extras/8cfa8d3e8f544e3284475e88fbd63b8d.avif?t=1780081438\" width=512 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I Believe In Gnomes is a fast-paced 3D platformer that takes it's inspiration from video games in the early 2000's. You explore this vibrant world as Gnorbert the gnome. Enjoy a nostalgia trip that also has the qualities and appeal of a modern 3D platformer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144660/extras/9c6b32f14b1966dc86926fdce857147d.avif?t=1780081438\" width=512 height=256 /></span> <br>The game was intentionally designed for any kind of player. If you want to have a traditional 3D platformer experience you can. If you want to move as fast as possible, that will depend on your skill. The game has no speed cap and can be taken as fast or slow as desired. The game is best enjoyed when pulling off speedy jumps mixed with deeper exploration as you collect all the gnomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144660/extras/c9ab07e7df8d3deb9f1088b487f60085.avif?t=1780081438\" width=512 height=256 /></span><br>Our story begins as Gnorbert the garden gnome is visited by the Great Flamingo and called upon to cleanse the garden from evil. Explore the backyard, sandbox, house, and more as you seek to save your fellow gnomes from certain destruction. Mixed in with the seriousness of your quest is a whole lot of satire and comedy.</p>", "short_description": "Join Gnorbert the Gnome on his quest to cleanse the garden. This 3D collectathon game offers a variety of surprises. Take the game at your speed you want as you seek to restore peace to the garden. Do you believe in Gnomes?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144660/de90507253e573f939572d5280eb529f0baeb9f8/header.jpg?t=1780081438", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144660/13afaeb3a8b2e41e9aab275c609cbef50facf0e6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780081438", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144660/13afaeb3a8b2e41e9aab275c609cbef50facf0e6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1780081438", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 and Windows 11, 64-bit versions only.<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> X64 architecture <br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DX10, DX11, and DX12-capable GPUs<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11, 64-bit versions only.<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> X64 architecture <br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> and DX12-capable GPUs<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10000 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS Tahoe (version 16.0 or later)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicon (Apple A18 Pro).<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 5-core GPU<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space